# HD texture assets — 49MB of CC0 material sets from ambientCG.
# Regenerable in one command, so there is no reason to carry them in
# version control:
#     node tools/fetch-hd-textures.mjs
# The fetcher is idempotent and rewrites public/hd/textures/LICENSE.txt
# with full provenance.
public/hd/textures/

